msgid "That person’s name"
msgstr "उस व्यक्ति का नाम"

#. Help for a command script variable.
msgid "The channel, as a mention"
msgstr "चैनल, मेंशन के रूप में"

#. Error message when uploaded file is not valid JSON
msgid "The chosen file is not a valid JSON object."
msgstr "चुनी गई फ़ाइल मान्य JSON ऑब्जेक्ट नहीं है।"

#. Error in Settings › Personas when the list of deleted personas fails to load
msgid "The deleted personas could not be loaded."
msgstr "डिलीट किए गए परसोना लोड नहीं हो सके।"

#. Shown on a member of the import file in the import review when its avatar or banner could not be stored or shown
msgid "The file's picture couldn't be loaded"
msgstr "फ़ाइल की तस्वीर लोड नहीं हो सकी"

#. Help for a command script variable.
msgid "The first person they mention, if any"
msgstr "पहला व्यक्ति जिसे वे मेंशन करें, अगर कोई हो"

#. Help for a command script variable.
msgid "The name of this community"
msgstr "इस कम्युनिटी का नाम"

#. Help for a command script variable.
msgid "The person running it, as a mention"
msgstr "इस्तेमाल करने वाला व्यक्ति, मेंशन के रूप में"

#. Error toast when restoring a deleted persona fails
msgid "The persona could not be restored."
msgstr "परसोना रीस्टोर नहीं हो सका।"

#. Description of the persona option of the /persona slash command
msgid "The persona to select."
msgstr "चुनने के लिए परसोना।"

#. Problem in a community command script: it produces more text than is allowed.
msgid "The script builds too much text."
msgstr "स्क्रिप्ट बहुत ज़्यादा टेक्स्ट बना रही है।"

#. Problem in a community command script.
msgid "The script is too long."
msgstr "स्क्रिप्ट बहुत लंबी है।"

#. Problem in a community command script.
msgid "The script took too long to run."
msgstr "स्क्रिप्ट चलाने में बहुत ज़्यादा समय लगा।"

msgid "The signal bar is off until you tick a channel here. Ticking a category or the whole community also covers channels created there later."
msgstr "जब तक आप यहाँ कोई चैनल नहीं चुनते, सिग्नल बार बंद रहता है। किसी श्रेणी या पूरी कम्युनिटी को चुनने पर वहाँ बाद में बनने वाले चैनल भी शामिल होते हैं।"

#. Import warning when the icon of the display tag in a Tyne export could not be stored. {error} is the reason, inserted by code.
msgid "The tag icon could not be stored: {error}. It can be set again in the persona settings."
msgstr "टैग आइकन सहेजा नहीं जा सका: {error}। इसे परसोना सेटिंग्स में फिर से सेट किया जा सकता है।"

#. Explanation of the "Updated from the file" line of the import result
msgid "Their details are the file's now; their messages and history stayed."
msgstr "उनकी जानकारी अब फ़ाइल वाली है; उनके संदेश और इतिहास बने रहे।"

#. Explains what deleting personas does, in its confirmation.
msgid "Their messages keep showing their names and avatars, but you can no longer send as them, and their tags and signature emojis become free. This can’t be undone."
msgstr "उनके संदेशों में उनके नाम और अवतार दिखते रहेंगे, लेकिन आप अब उनके रूप में संदेश नहीं भेज पाएँगे, और उनके टैग और हस्ताक्षर इमोजी खाली हो जाएँगे। इसे पूर्ववत नहीं किया जा सकता।"

#. Help for a command script variable.
msgid "Their name"
msgstr "इस्तेमाल करने वाले का नाम"

#. Explains what making personas private does, in its confirmation.
msgid "Their profiles will be hidden from others. Their names and avatars still show on their messages and reactions."
msgstr "उनकी प्रोफ़ाइल दूसरों से छिपा दी जाएगी। उनके नाम और अवतार उनके संदेशों और प्रतिक्रियाओं पर दिखते रहेंगे।"

#. Shown in place of the restore confirmation for signals everywhere when there is no earlier change to undo.
msgid "There is nothing to restore."
msgstr "रीस्टोर करने के लिए कुछ नहीं है।"

#. Problem in a community command script. {name} is what was written, such as "upcse". Preserve {name}.
msgid "There's no filter called {name}."
msgstr "{name} नाम का कोई फ़िल्टर नहीं है।"

#. Problem in a community command script. {name} is what was written, such as "for". Preserve {name}.
msgid "There's no tag called {name}."
msgstr "{name} नाम का कोई टैग नहीं है।"

#. Explanation at the top of the import review. {productName} is the app name
msgid "These look like personas you already have in {productName}. For each one, pick what {productName} should have. Not sure? Leave it as it is: nothing changes."
msgstr "ये ऐसे परसोना लगते हैं जो {productName} में आपके पास पहले से हैं। हर एक के लिए चुनें कि {productName} में कौन-सा रहे। पक्का नहीं पता? इसे जैसा है वैसा ही छोड़ दें: कुछ नहीं बदलेगा।"

#. Error in the persona import dialog when the chosen .zip file is damaged
msgid "This .zip file could not be read."
msgstr "यह .zip फ़ाइल पढ़ी नहीं जा सकी।"

#. Error in the persona import dialog when the chosen .zip file is not a persona export. Preserve {productName}; it is the app name, inserted by code.
msgid "This .zip file is not a persona export from {productName}."
msgstr "यह .zip फ़ाइल {productName} का परसोना एक्सपोर्ट नहीं है।"

#. Body of the dialog confirming that a command is deleted.
msgid "This can't be undone. Messages made with it still show which command made them."
msgstr "इसे वापस नहीं किया जा सकता। इससे बने मैसेज अब भी दिखाते हैं कि उन्हें किस कमांड ने बनाया।"

#. Empty state text in the Commands tab.
msgid "This community doesn't have any commands yet."
msgstr "इस कम्युनिटी में अभी कोई कमांड नहीं है।"

#. Validation error when signature emoji is duplicated within the same persona
msgid "This emoji is already added as a signature emoji"
msgstr "यह इमोजी पहले से ही एक हस्ताक्षर इमोजी के रूप में जोड़ा गया है"

msgid "This is a preview of how your display tag will look in chat."
msgstr "यह इस बात का पूर्वावलोकन है कि आपका डिस्प्ले टैग चैट में कैसा दिखेगा।"

#. Problem in a community command script: a syntax error at the position given before this text.
msgid "This part can't be read."
msgstr "यह हिस्सा पढ़ा नहीं जा सकता।"

#. Problem in a community command script: it failed while running, at the position given before this text.
msgid "This part stopped with an error."
msgstr "यह हिस्सा गड़बड़ी के साथ रुक गया।"

msgid "This persona’s profile is private."
msgstr "इस परसोना की प्रोफ़ाइल निजी है।"

#. Shown instead of the preview when a command script produces no text.
msgid "This would post nothing, so the command would fail."
msgstr "इससे कुछ भी पोस्ट नहीं होगा, इसलिए कमांड विफल हो जाएगा।"

#. Sentence under the signal bar editor description. The globe panel opens from the globe button at the end of the signal bar.
msgid "Ticked signals can also be set in every chat at once, from the globe panel."
msgstr "टिक किए गए सिग्नल ग्लोब पैनल से एक साथ हर चैट में भी सेट किए जा सकते हैं।"

#. Keyboard shortcut action label shown in the shortcuts list and keybind editor. Keep short, sentence case.
msgid "Toggle the channel list"
msgstr "चैनल सूची टॉगल करें"

msgid "Total Members"
msgstr "कुल सदस्य"

#. Button in the signals-everywhere panel that turns off every signal you have on, in every chat. Keep it short.
msgid "Turn all off"
msgstr "सब बंद करें"

#. Direct message right-click menu action that hides the signal bar in this DM and clears its signals.
msgid "Turn off signal bar"
msgstr "सिग्नल बार बंद करें"

#. Signal bar right-click menu action, for moderators, that turns one person's signal off. {name} is the persona or account name the signal is currently shown as.
msgid "Turn off {name}"
msgstr "{name} बंद करें"

#. Direct message right-click menu action that shows the signal bar above the message box in this DM.
msgid "Turn on signal bar"
msgstr "सिग्नल बार चालू करें"

#. Last install step: the app starts after installing.
msgid "Tyne opens by itself. Sign in and you're done."
msgstr "Tyne अपने-आप खुल जाता है। साइन इन करें, बस हो गया।"

#. Placeholder in the empty command script editor. {output} and {tag} are the characters to type; preserve them.
msgid "Type {output} or {tag} for suggestions."
msgstr "सुझावों के लिए {output} या {tag} टाइप करें।"

#. Explanation under the persona editor's switch for not matching a persona's tags.
msgid "Typing one of these tags won't switch to this persona. The tag is sent as written."
msgstr "इनमें से कोई टैग लिखने पर इस परसोना पर स्विच नहीं होगा। टैग वैसा ही भेजा जाएगा जैसा लिखा गया है।"

#. Under the .deb download button: the Linux distributions that use .deb packages.
msgid "Ubuntu, Debian, Linux Mint"
msgstr "Ubuntu, Debian, Linux Mint"

#. Under "Linux" in the list of platforms: Linux distributions the Tyne app installs on.
msgid "Ubuntu, Fedora and more"
msgstr "Ubuntu, Fedora और भी बहुत कुछ"

#. Badge on one’s own persona in the Personas list: others do not see it in the list.
#. Chip above the persona list: unlisted personas.
#. Persona visibility unlisted
msgid "Unlisted"
msgstr "अनलिस्टेड"

#. Emoji context menu action that unpins the emoji.
msgid "Unpin emoji"
msgstr "इमोजी अनपिन करें"

#. Emoji context menu action that unpins the emoji for the active persona.
msgid "Unpin for this persona"
msgstr "इस परसोना के लिए अनपिन करें"

#. Helper description for Manual persona mode
msgid "Untagged messages send as the persona you picked. A tag applies to that message only."
msgstr "बिना टैग वाले संदेश आपके चुने हुए परसोना के रूप में भेजे जाते हैं। टैग केवल उसी संदेश पर लागू होता है।"

#. Helper description for Last Used persona mode
msgid "Untagged messages send as whoever spoke last. Using a tag switches to that persona."
msgstr "बिना टैग वाले संदेश उसी के रूप में भेजे जाते हैं जिसने आख़िरी बार बात की। टैग का उपयोग करने पर वही परसोना चुन लिया जाता है।"

#. Line of the import result: personas given the file's details
msgid "Updated from the file"
msgstr "फ़ाइल से अपडेट किए गए"

#. Tooltip on the chip that shows which community command made a message. Preserve {name}.
msgid "Use /{name}"
msgstr "/{name} इस्तेमाल करें"

#. Tooltip on the chip that shows which community command made a message, naming the community it belongs to. Preserve {name} and {community}.
msgid "Use /{name} from {community}"
msgstr "{community} का /{name} इस्तेमाल करें"

#. Shown after pressing Import in the persona import dialog, before anything happens
msgid "Use Export to make a backup before continuing."
msgstr "आगे बढ़ने से पहले बैकअप बनाने के लिए एक्सपोर्ट का इस्तेमाल करें।"

#. Permission description in the channel permissions editor for the Use external commands permission.
msgid "Use commands from other communities in this channel."
msgstr "इस चैनल में दूसरी कम्युनिटी के कमांड इस्तेमाल करें।"

#. Permission description in the role editor for the Use external commands permission. "Other communities" means slash commands made in a different community.
msgid "Use commands from other communities."
msgstr "दूसरी कम्युनिटी के कमांड इस्तेमाल करें।"

#. Permission name: allows using slash commands made in other communities.
msgid "Use external commands"
msgstr "बाहरी कमांड इस्तेमाल करें"

#. Help under a community command counter. {variable} is code such as {{ hugs }}. Preserve {variable}.
msgid "Use it in a script as {variable}. Each run adds one first, so the first run reads 1."
msgstr "इसे स्क्रिप्ट में {variable} के रूप में इस्तेमाल करें। हर रन पहले एक जोड़ता है, इसलिए पहला रन 1 पढ़ता है।"

#. Error under the name of a community command counter.
msgid "Use lowercase letters, numbers and _, starting with a letter, and not a name scripts already use."
msgstr "छोटे अंग्रेज़ी अक्षर, अंक और _ इस्तेमाल करें, अक्षर से शुरू करें, और ऐसा नाम न लें जो स्क्रिप्ट पहले से इस्तेमाल करती हैं।"

#. Error under the command name field when the name is not allowed.
msgid "Use lowercase letters, numbers, - and _, up to 32 characters."
msgstr "छोटे अक्षर, अंक, - और _ इस्तेमाल करें, अधिकतम 32 वर्ण।"

#. Button in the command editor that switches back from the code editor to the plain message field.
msgid "Use the basic editor"
msgstr "बेसिक एडिटर इस्तेमाल करें"

#. Option of the three-way switch for a persona that differs from the import file: the file's version replaces the app's
msgctxt "persona-import-switch"
msgid "Use the file's"
msgstr "फ़ाइल वाला इस्तेमाल करें"

#. Button in the command editor that switches the message field to the code editor for scripts.
msgid "Use the script editor"
msgstr "स्क्रिप्ट एडिटर इस्तेमाल करें"

#. Option of the three-way switch for a persona that differs from the import file: the app's version stays and the file's is not imported. {productName} is the app name
msgid "Use {productName}'s"
msgstr "{productName} वाला इस्तेमाल करें"

#. Badge on a collapsed persona in the import review: the import file's version replaces it
msgid "Using the file's"
msgstr "फ़ाइल वाला"

#. OAuth scope description shown on the consent screen for the personas.read scope.
msgid "View your personas"
msgstr "अपने परसोना देखें"

#. Button inserting the placeholder for what the member types after the command.
#. Help for a command script variable.
msgid "What they type"
msgstr "वे जो टाइप करते हैं"

#. Shown in the channel when a community command is sent with a line break in its input. Preserve {name}.
msgid "What you type after /{name} has to fit on one line."
msgstr "/{name} के बाद आप जो टाइप करें, वह एक पंक्ति में आना चाहिए।"

#. Install step on macOS. 'Done' is the button of macOS' warning that an app was not opened: use macOS' own wording.
msgid "When macOS says Tyne wasn't opened, click <0>Done</0>."
msgstr "जब macOS बताए कि Tyne नहीं खुला, तो <0>हो गया</0> पर क्लिक करें।"

msgid "Where the signal bar appears"
msgstr "सिग्नल बार कहाँ दिखे"

#. Aria label for the tabs that choose whether the selected persona applies everywhere or per channel
msgid "Where your persona is remembered"
msgstr "आपका परसोना कहाँ याद रखा जाता है"

#. Question over the personas a member of the import file might be. {name} is the member
msgid "Which persona is {name}?"
msgstr "{name} कौन-सा परसोना है?"

#. Which Windows versions the Tyne app needs.
msgid "Windows 10 or 11"
msgstr "Windows 10 या 11"

#. Title of Windows' SmartScreen warning, drawn on the download page: use Windows' own wording in this language.
msgid "Windows protected your PC"
msgstr "Windows ने आपके PC की सुरक्षा की"

#. Help for an example in a command script. Translators: keep the English examples 1st, 2nd, 3rd.
msgid "Write a number as 1st, 2nd, 3rd"
msgstr "संख्या को 1st, 2nd, 3rd की तरह लिखें"

#. Question in the import review for a persona that was deleted. {name} is its name, {productName} the app name, {date} a date
msgid "You deleted {name} in {productName} on {date}. Bring {name} back?"
msgstr "आपने {date} को {productName} में {name} को डिलीट किया था। {name} को वापस लाएँ?"

#. Question in the import review for a persona that was deleted. {name} is its name, {productName} the app name
msgid "You deleted {name} in {productName}. Bring {name} back?"
msgstr "आपने {productName} में {name} को डिलीट किया था। {name} को वापस लाएँ?"

#. Text of the confirmation when the persona import review is closed before importing
msgid "Your choices for these members will be lost, and nothing is imported."
msgstr "इन सदस्यों के लिए आपके चुनाव खो जाएँगे, और कुछ भी इंपोर्ट नहीं होगा।"

#. Question in the import review when the import file has another display tag. {productName} is the app name
msgid "Your display tag shows after every persona's name. Which one should {productName} use?"
msgstr "आपका डिस्प्ले टैग हर परसोना के नाम के बाद दिखता है। {productName} कौन-सा इस्तेमाल करे?"

#. On the download page after the visitor chose to download the app elsewhere.
msgid "Your download should start in a moment. If it doesn't, use the button above."
msgstr "आपका डाउनलोड कुछ ही पलों में शुरू हो जाना चाहिए। अगर न हो, तो ऊपर दिए गए बटन का इस्तेमाल करें।"

#. Column heading in the import review, above the import file side; the other column is the app name
msgid "Your file"
msgstr "आपकी फ़ाइल"

msgid "Your reactions"
msgstr "आपके रिएक्शन"

#. Tooltip and accessible label of the globe button at the end of the signal bar. It opens a panel listing every chat where you have a signal on. {count} is how many chats that is.
msgid "Your signals everywhere · {count, plural, one {# chat} other {# chats}}"
msgstr "हर जगह आपके सिग्नल · {count, plural, one {# चैट} other {# चैट}}"

#. Accessible name of the popout listing which of your personas reacted with an emoji. Preserve {emojiName}.
msgid "Your {emojiName} reactions"
msgstr "आपके {emojiName} रिएक्शन"

#. Part of the import summary "Import will link 17, add 7, skip 3"
msgid "add {count}"
msgstr "{count} जोड़ेगा"

#. Progress label for avatar downloads
msgid "avatars downloaded"
msgstr "अवतार डाउनलोड हुए"

#. Progress label for banner downloads during persona import
msgid "banners downloaded"
msgstr "बैनर डाउनलोड हुए"

#. Part of the import summary "Import will add 7 and change your display tag"
msgid "change your display tag"
msgstr "आपका डिस्प्ले टैग बदलेगा"

#. Placeholder for persona name
msgid "e.g. Alice"
msgstr "जैसे Alice"

#. Placeholder of the display tag text input; an example of a system or group name, as in Alice in Wonderland
msgid "e.g. Wonderland"
msgstr "जैसे वंडरलैंड"

#. Placeholder for persona pronouns
msgid "e.g. she/her"
msgstr "जैसे वह"

#. Placeholder text for natural language timestamp input.
msgid "e.g. tomorrow at 3pm, in 2 hours, now"
msgstr "उदा. कल दोपहर 3 बजे, 2 घंटे में, अभी"

#. Which iPhone and iPad system versions the Tyne app needs.
msgid "iOS 16 or newer"
msgstr "iOS 16 या नया"

#. Progress label while the images inside an imported persona export are stored
msgid "images stored"
msgstr "इमेज सेव हुईं"

#. What the import progress counts when no more specific name is known, as in "3 of 10 items (30%)"
msgid "items"
msgstr "आइटम"

#. Part of the import summary "Import will link 17, add 7, skip 3"
msgid "link {count}"
msgstr "{count} को लिंक करेगा"

#. Label in the message reactions, on an emoji one of your personas reacted with: pressing it lists your account and personas so you can add or remove each one. Keep the tone plain.
msgid "press to see your reactions"
msgstr "अपने रिएक्शन देखने के लिए दबाएँ"

#. Part of the import summary "Import will link 17, restore 2, skip 3"
msgid "restore {count}"
msgstr "{count} रीस्टोर करेगा"

#. Progress label when saving personas
msgid "saving personas"
msgstr "परसोना सेव हुए"

#. Part of the import summary "Import will link 17, add 7, skip 3"
msgid "skip {count}"
msgstr "{count} छोड़ेगा"

#. Stands for the message text between a tag pair's prefix and suffix inputs, as in "a:text"
#. Stands for the message text between a tag pair's prefix and suffix, as in "a:text"
#. Stands for the message text between a tag pair's prefix and suffix, as in "a:text"
#. Stands for the message text between a tag pair's prefix and suffix, as in "a:text"
msgid "text"
msgstr "टेक्स्ट"

#. Part of the import summary "Import will link 17, use the file's version for 2"
msgid "use the file's version for {count}"
msgstr "{count} के लिए फ़ाइल वाला वर्शन इस्तेमाल करेगा"

#. placeholder {0}: progress.current
#. placeholder {1}: progress.total
#. placeholder {2}: progress.label ?? i18n._(PROGRESS_ITEMS_DESCRIPTOR)
#. placeholder {3}: progress.percent
msgid "{0} of {1} {2} ({3}%)"
msgstr "{1} में से {0} {2} ({3}%)"

#. Heading when a persona import with nothing to decide is done. {addedCount} is a number
msgid "{addedCount} personas added"
msgstr "जोड़े गए परसोना: {addedCount}"

#. Native desktop dialog headline shown when an update has finished downloading. {appName} is the desktop app name and {version} the new version number.
msgid "{appName} {version} is ready to install."
msgstr "{appName} {version} इंस्टॉल करने के लिए तैयार है।"

#. Line at the top of the import review: members already linked to an identical persona, or connected to one with the same name and tag. {count} is a number
msgid "{count, plural, one {# exact match} other {# exact matches}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# सटीक मिलान} other {# सटीक मिलान}}"

#. Heading in the import review over the list of members whose proxy tag another persona already has
msgid "{count, plural, one {# member has a tag that is already taken} other {# members have a tag that is already taken}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# सदस्य का टैग पहले से लिया हुआ है} other {# सदस्यों के टैग पहले से लिए हुए हैं}}"

#. Heading in the import review over the members that share a name or tag with personas of the account
msgid "{count, plural, one {# member might be a persona you already have} other {# members might be personas you already have}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# सदस्य शायद आपका कोई मौजूदा परसोना है} other {# सदस्य शायद आपके मौजूदा परसोना हैं}}"

#. Line at the top of the import review. {count} is a number of members of the import file
msgid "{count, plural, one {# new member} other {# new members}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# नया सदस्य} other {# नए सदस्य}}"

#. Line at the top of the import review. {count} is a number, {productName} the app name
msgid "{count, plural, one {# persona in {productName} isn't in your file} other {# personas in {productName} aren't in your file}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {{productName} का # परसोना आपकी फ़ाइल में नहीं है} other {{productName} के # परसोना आपकी फ़ाइल में नहीं हैं}}"

#. Heading in the import review over the list of personas whose details differ from the import file. {count} is how many
msgid "{count, plural, one {# persona is different in your file} other {# personas are different in your file}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {आपकी फ़ाइल में # परसोना अलग है} other {आपकी फ़ाइल में # परसोना अलग हैं}}"

#. Toast after making personas private; it has an Undo button.
msgid "{count, plural, one {# persona is} other {# personas are}} now private"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# परसोना अब प्राइवेट है} other {# परसोना अब प्राइवेट हैं}}"

#. Toast after making personas public; it has an Undo button.
msgid "{count, plural, one {# persona is} other {# personas are}} now public"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# परसोना अब पब्लिक है} other {# परसोना अब पब्लिक हैं}}"

#. Toast after making personas unlisted; it has an Undo button.
msgid "{count, plural, one {# persona is} other {# personas are}} now unlisted"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# परसोना अब अनलिस्टेड है} other {# परसोना अब अनलिस्टेड हैं}}"

#. Second line of the import review footer
msgid "{count, plural, one {# persona stays as it is} other {# personas stay as they are}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# परसोना जैसा है वैसा ही रहेगा} other {# परसोना जैसे हैं वैसे ही रहेंगे}}"

#. Heading in the import review over the members whose persona was deleted. {productName} is the app name
msgid "{count, plural, one {# persona was deleted in {productName}} other {# personas were deleted in {productName}}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {{productName} में # परसोना हटाया गया था} other {{productName} में # परसोना हटाए गए थे}}"

#. How many personas the Personas list shows.
msgid "{count, plural, one {# persona} other {# personas}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# परसोना} other {# परसोना}}"

#. Toast after deleting personas.
msgid "{count, plural, one {# persona} other {# personas}} deleted"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# परसोना हटाया गया} other {# परसोना हटाए गए}}"

#. On a collapsed member in the import review: how many personas of the account it might be
msgid "{count, plural, one {# possible match} other {# possible matches}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# संभावित मिलान} other {# संभावित मिलान}}"

#. Last line of the list in the restore confirmation when more chats change than are listed.
msgid "{count, plural, one {+ # more chat} other {+ # more chats}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {+ # और चैट} other {+ # और चैट}}"

#. Title of the persona import review. {count} is the number of members that need a choice
msgid "{count, plural, one {Check # member before importing} other {Check # members before importing}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {इंपोर्ट करने से पहले # सदस्य जाँचें} other {इंपोर्ट करने से पहले # सदस्य जाँचें}}"

#. How often a persona has been used, shown in the import review
#. How often a persona has been used, shown in the import review
msgid "{count, plural, one {Used once} other {Used # times}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# बार इस्तेमाल हुआ} other {# बार इस्तेमाल हुआ}}"

msgid "{count} notice(s) during import"
msgstr "इंपोर्ट के दौरान सूचनाएँ: {count}"

#. In the "Your reactions" popout: how many of your identities (the account and its personas) reacted, out of all of them. Preserve {count} and {total}.
msgid "{count} of {total}"
msgstr "{total} में से {count}"

#. Under the "React as..." title: how many of your identities (the account and its personas) reacted with this emoji, out of all of them. Preserve {count} and {total}.
msgid "{count} of {total} reacted"
msgstr "{total} में से {count} ने रिएक्ट किया"

#. How many personas are selected in settings. Preserve {count}.
msgid "{count} selected"
msgstr "{count} चुने गए"

#. Second line of the import review footer: deleted personas that are not restored
msgid "{count} stay deleted"
msgstr "डिलीट ही रहेंगे: {count}"

#. Instance selector error shown when the instance speaks a protocol generation this client does not know. Domain is interpolated. productName is the name of this app.
msgid "{domain} runs a newer version of {productName} than this app. Update {productName}, then try again."
msgstr "{domain} {productName} का एक नया संस्करण चलाता है जो इस ऐप से पुराना है। {productName} को अपडेट करें, फिर पुनः प्रयास करें।"

#. Accessible label on a lit signal icon. {label} is the signal name such as Reading, {names} is a comma-separated list of the people who turned it on.
msgid "{label}: {names}"
msgstr "{label}: {names}"

#. A clash in the import review. {label} is a proxy tag or emoji, {names} a list of persona names
msgid "{names} would all have {label}. Change one of the choices."
msgstr "{names} सभी को {label} मिलेगा। कोई एक विकल्प बदलें।"

#. Tooltip when sending as a latched persona
msgid "{name} ({mode}) - Click to switch persona"
msgstr "{name} ({mode}) - परसोना बदलने के लिए क्लिक करें"

#. Status beside the field for a new proxy tag in the import review. {name} is the persona that has it
msgid "{name} already has it"
msgstr "{name} पहले से इसका इस्तेमाल करता है"

#. Toast after a deleted persona was restored
msgid "{name} is back."
msgstr "{name} वापस आ गया।"

#. Question in the import review for a persona whose details differ from the import file. {name} is its name, {productName} the app name
msgid "{name} is different in your file. Which one should {productName} have?"
msgstr "आपकी फ़ाइल में {name} अलग है। {productName} में कौन-सा रहना चाहिए?"

#. Problem in a community command script. {name} is a piece of the script, such as {% if target %}. Preserve {name}.
msgid "{name} is never closed."
msgstr "{name} कभी बंद नहीं होता।"

#. Heading in the import review for a member whose proxy tag another persona or member already has. {name} is its name
msgid "{name}'s tag is already taken"
msgstr "{name} का टैग पहले से इस्तेमाल में है"

#. Which persona of the list is shown, as in "3 of 12". Preserve {position} and {total}.
msgid "{position} of {total}"
msgstr "{total} में से {position}"

#. Status shown when browser sign-in status polling gives up after repeated failures. productName is the name of this app.
msgid "{productName} stopped checking whether the browser approved this sign-in. It didn't lose your code."
msgstr "{productName} ने यह जांचना बंद कर दिया कि ब्राउज़र ने इस साइन-इन को मंजूरी दी है या नहीं। इसने आपका कोड नहीं खोया है।"

msgid "{publicCount} public, {unlistedCount} unlisted, {privateCount} private"
msgstr "{publicCount} पब्लिक, {unlistedCount} अनलिस्टेड, {privateCount} प्राइवेट"

#. How many personas match the search, out of all shown. Preserve {shown} and {total}.
msgid "{shown} of {total} personas"
msgstr "{total} में से {shown} परसोना"

msgid "— Today at 12:00 PM"
msgstr "— आज दोपहर 12:00 बजे"

#. Title of macOS' warning that an app was not opened, drawn on the download page: use macOS' own wording.
msgid "“Tyne” Not Opened"
msgstr "“Tyne” नहीं खुला"

#. Text in macOS' Privacy & Security settings after an app was blocked: use macOS' own wording.
msgid "“Tyne” was blocked."
msgstr "“Tyne” को ब्लॉक किया गया।"
